%SIXMD 1
# @?DF - PRINT FILESYSTEM SPACE

## DESCRIPTION

DF PRINTS CURRENT MEMFS USED, CAPACITY, AND FREE WORD COUNTS.  OTHER
FILESYSTEMS DO NOT YET EXPORT A COMMON CAPACITY ACCOUNTING ABI.
USAGE IS 'DF'.

## @?EXIT STATUS

### @?0 - SUCCESS
### @?1 - OPERATION FAILED OR CONDITION FALSE
### @?2 - INVALID USAGE WHEN APPLICABLE
